{
  "info": {
    "name": "CLD376 - Member 1 (Gateway, Vehicles, Bookings)",
    "description": "Member 1's requests: Gateway, Vehicles and Bookings. Run the folders in order.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Set the variables (click the collection name, then the Variables tab). gateway is http://localhost:3000 locally, or http://<EC2-1 public IP>:3000 on EC2.\n2. Run the 4 requests in \"0. Log in\" and paste each token into customerToken, customer2Token, mechanicToken and managerToken.\n3. Open each request, read its description for the expected result, and click Send.\n4. When a request says \"copy its _id\", copy the _id from the response into that variable.\n\nIf there are no seeded users yet, you can make test tokens yourself instead. In services/api-gateway, run this once per role, changing the role and the last digit of sub:\n\n  JWT_SECRET=<the shared secret> node -e \"console.log(require('jsonwebtoken').sign({sub:'66f1c2a9e4b0a1b2c3d4e5f1',role:'customer',name:'Test'},process.env.JWT_SECRET,{expiresIn:'1h'}))\"\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Log in",
      "description": "Log in as the seeded test users (scripts/seed-users.js). Run these first. Tokens last 1 hour; log in again when they expire.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Log in as Customer 1",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "Expect 200 with a token. Copy \"token\" from the response into the customerToken variable.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer1@shop.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Test1234!\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Log in as Customer 2",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "Expect 200 with a token. Copy \"token\" from the response into the customer2Token variable.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer2@shop.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Test1234!\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Log in as Mechanic 1",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "Expect 200 with a token. Copy \"token\" from the response into the mechanicToken variable.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"mechanic1@shop.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Test1234!\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Log in as Manager",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "Expect 200 with a token. Copy \"token\" from the response into the managerToken variable.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"manager@shop.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Test1234!\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Gateway",
      "description": "These only need the gateway running. The gateway answers them itself.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Gateway is up",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/health",
            "description": "Expect 200: { service: \"api-gateway\", status: \"ok\", upstreams: {...} }",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "N2: No token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/bookings",
            "description": "Expect 401 NO_TOKEN.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "N3: Broken token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/auth/me",
            "description": "Before sending: in the Authorization tab, add one extra letter to the end of the token. Expect 401 INVALID_TOKEN.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "N4: Customer tries to add a catalog service",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/catalog",
            "description": "Expect 403 FORBIDDEN. Only managers can do this.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test service\",\n  \"priceCents\": 1000,\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "N5: Mechanic tries to make an invoice",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/invoices",
            "description": "Expect 403 FORBIDDEN. Only managers can do this.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{mechanicToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"workOrderId\": \"000000000000000000000000\",\n  \"lineItems\": [],\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Route not in policy.js is blocked",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/anything",
            "description": "Expect 403 FORBIDDEN. Anything not listed in policy.js is blocked.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{managerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Load balancer: catalog health (send 4 times)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/catalog/health",
            "description": "Needs both Service Catalog copies running (Member 3). Send 4 times: instance should go catalog-a, catalog-b, catalog-a, catalog-b.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Vehicles",
      "description": "Needs the gateway and the Vehicles service running.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Customer A adds a car",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles",
            "description": "Expect 201 with the new car. Copy its _id into the vehicleId variable.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plateNumber\": \"M1-1001\",\n  \"make\": \"Toyota\",\n  \"model\": \"Camry\",\n  \"year\": 2020,\n  \"color\": \"white\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Customer A lists their cars",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles",
            "description": "Expect 200, a list with only Customer A's cars.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Customer B lists their cars",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles",
            "description": "Expect 200 and an empty list []. Customer B can't see A's cars.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customer2Token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mechanic lists all cars",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles",
            "description": "Expect 200, a list with every car.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{mechanicToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Customer A reads their car",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}",
            "description": "Expect 200 with the car.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Customer A updates their car",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}",
            "description": "Expect 200, color is now red.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"color\": \"red\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Manager updates the car",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}",
            "description": "Expect 200, color is now black. ownerId does not change.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{managerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"color\": \"black\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "N6: Customer B reads Customer A's car",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}",
            "description": "Expect 403 FORBIDDEN.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customer2Token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mechanic tries to add a car",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles",
            "description": "Expect 403 FORBIDDEN. Only customers add cars.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{mechanicToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plateNumber\": \"M1-1002\",\n  \"make\": \"Toyota\",\n  \"model\": \"Camry\",\n  \"year\": 2020,\n  \"color\": \"white\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Same plate twice",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles",
            "description": "Expect 409 DUPLICATE. Plate M1-1001 is already taken.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customer2Token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plateNumber\": \"M1-1001\",\n  \"make\": \"Toyota\",\n  \"model\": \"Camry\",\n  \"year\": 2020,\n  \"color\": \"white\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Missing field",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles",
            "description": "Expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR. make is required.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plateNumber\": \"M1-1003\",\n  \"model\": \"Camry\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Fake role header is ignored",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "x-user-role",
                "value": "manager"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/vehicles",
            "description": "Sends a fake x-user-role: manager header. Expect 201, and ownerId is still Customer A. The gateway replaces fake headers.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plateNumber\": \"M1-1004\",\n  \"make\": \"Toyota\",\n  \"model\": \"Camry\",\n  \"year\": 2020,\n  \"color\": \"white\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Bookings",
      "description": "Needs the gateway, Vehicles and Booking running. Run 2. Vehicles first so vehicleId is set.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Customer A books a service",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/bookings",
            "description": "Expect 201, status pending. Copy its _id into the bookingId variable.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vehicleId\": \"{{vehicleId}}\",\n  \"serviceRequested\": \"Oil change\",\n  \"preferredDate\": \"2030-01-15T02:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"note\": \"Squeaking when braking\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Customer A lists their bookings",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/bookings",
            "description": "Expect 200, a list with Customer A's bookings.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Manager lists pending bookings",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/bookings?status=pending",
            "description": "Expect 200, a list that includes bookingId.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{managerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Manager approves the booking",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/status",
            "description": "Expect 200, status approved.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{managerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"approved\",\n  \"managerNote\": \"Bring the car at 9am\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Customer A books again",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/bookings",
            "description": "Expect 201. Copy its _id into the bookingId2 variable.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vehicleId\": \"{{vehicleId}}\",\n  \"serviceRequested\": \"Oil change\",\n  \"preferredDate\": \"2030-01-15T02:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"note\": \"Squeaking when braking\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Customer A cancels the second booking",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId2}}/status",
            "description": "Expect 200, status cancelled.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"cancelled\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "N9: Customer B books Customer A's car",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/bookings",
            "description": "Expect 400 VEHICLE_NOT_OWNED.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customer2Token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vehicleId\": \"{{vehicleId}}\",\n  \"serviceRequested\": \"Oil change\",\n  \"preferredDate\": \"2030-01-15T02:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"note\": \"Squeaking when braking\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Date in the past",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/bookings",
            "description": "Expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vehicleId\": \"{{vehicleId}}\",\n  \"serviceRequested\": \"Oil change\",\n  \"preferredDate\": \"2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"note\": \"Squeaking when braking\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Customer tries to approve",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId2}}/status",
            "description": "Expect 403 FORBIDDEN. Customers can only cancel.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"approved\",\n  \"activity\": \"midterm\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
